# q with no project tagged @inbox opens Quick Add with the project picker, whatever a project is called; Esc twice closes both and adds nothing.
file <<END
Inbox:
	- Old item
END
keys q
see ┌Project
keys <Esc>
hide ┌Project
type x
see Choose a project with Tab
keys <Esc>
hide Quick Add
quit
saved <<END
Inbox:
	- Old item
END
